  "chain": "corrosion bonding (PCV-0005) / setpoint spring relaxation (4 valves) [cause B, design/manufacturing] -> five MSRVs found outside +/-3% setpoint band -> MSRVs conservatively inoperable for indeterminate period (Apr 2019-Feb 2021) -> TS 3.0.4 violated on four mode entries -> TS 3.4.3/3.0.4 violation reported [MSRV Actuation Logic electrical backup available throughout]",
